      "text": [
        " : سَأَلْتُهُ عَنِ اَلْمُحْرِمَةِ إِذَا طَهُرَتْ تَغْسِلُ رَأْسَهَا بِالْخِطْمِيِّ فَقَالَ «يُجْزِيهَا اَلْمَاءُ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2758 - Muhammad ibn Muslim narrated from one of the Imams (as): I asked him about a woman in the state of ihram who becomes pure (from menstruation). Can she wash her head with sidr (a cleansing plant like lote)?\nImam (as) said: \"Water alone suffices for her.\""
        ]
      }
